      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Panel can be collapsed, it is opened by default. When it is closed, then the Voyager viewing space dynamically enlarges. *Might be difficult or tricky with varying screen sizes...\n",
