      "updated": 1763552793632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(all fields are free text)\n\nWorkflow and Methodology: \nSoftware and Tools: \nScale (is it to scale? Metric vs Imperial. Unit level. etc.) \nGeometric quality control (validation using a certain plugin or modifier, etc. is there overlapping geometry, etc. - implications for 3D printing)  \nModel resolution \n    polygon count \n    imagine texture dimensions \nModifications (hole-filling, smoothing, decimation, deleting etc.) \nVariants\nUncertainty\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(all fields are free text)\n\nWorkflow and Methodology: \nSoftware and Tools: \nScale (is it to scale? Metric vs Imperial. Unit level. etc.) \nGeometric quality control (validation using a certain plugin or modifier, etc. is there overlapping geometry, etc. - implications for 3D printing)  \nModel resolution \n    polygon count \n    imagine texture dimensions \nModifications (hole-filling, smoothing, decimation, deleting etc.) \nVariants\nUncertainty\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
